                <text x='18' y='188' fill='#FFFFFF' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold'>云端 AI（可选 · 可断开）</text>
                <text x='18' y='208' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='13'>DeepSeek / Ollama / 自定义，走 OpenAI 兼容协议 —— 换模型只改地址</text>

                <rect x='0' y='228' width='540' height='56' rx='8' fill='#151B33' stroke='#334155' />
                <text x='18' y='254' fill='#FFFFFF' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold'>本地 AI（离线也能跑）</text>
                <text x='18' y='274' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='13'>transformers.js + bge-small-zh 向量　tesseract OCR　规则兜底</text>

                <rect x='0' y='294' width='540' height='56' rx='8' fill='#151B33' stroke='#334155' />
                <text x='18' y='320' fill='#FFFFFF' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold'>本地存储</text>
                <text x='18' y='340' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='13'>IndexedDB（Dexie v1→v4）· OPFS · 向量 512 维</text>

                <rect x='0' y='360' width='540' height='40' rx='8' fill='#151B33' stroke='#334155' />
                <text x='18' y='385' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='13'>桌面壳 Rust 484 行（通知 / 托盘 / 悬浮窗）　聚合服务 Python（调度 → 抓取 → 去重 → 补正文）</text>
            </g>

